#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:4
msgid "Known limitations"
msgstr "已知局限"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page lists the limits of ANet 0.3 that are not stated elsewhere: "
"where a protection ends, which behavior departs from a specification, and"
" what this release does not do. The limits of confidentiality, forward "
"secrecy, identity keys, payments and local execution are described in "
":doc:`security`. The limitations are listed so that a decision to hand "
"data to the network is made with knowledge of them."
msgstr ""
"本页列出 ANet 0.3 "
"中其他页面未说明的局限：保护在何处终止、哪些行为与规范不一致，以及本版本不做的事项。关于机密性、前向保密、身份密钥、支付和本地执行的局限，参见 "
":doc:`security`。列出这些局限，是为了在决定把数据交给网络之前，对其有充分了解。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:19
msgid "Tasks and messages"
msgstr "任务与消息"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:21
msgid "A blocking call waits as long as the task needs"
msgstr "阻塞调用会等到任务需要的时间"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:22
msgid ""
"A ``SendMessage`` through the local A2A interface with "
"``return_immediately`` unset returns only when the task reaches a final "
"or interrupted state. This can take a long time when the other node is "
"offline. A timeout on the side of the client does not cancel the task. "
"The task keeps running, it may already have been paid for within the "
"automatic limit, and a repetition of the call creates a second task. "
"Deduplication by ``contextId`` and ``messageId`` does not help a client "
"that generates a new ``messageId`` for every call. An earlier task is "
"found with ``ListTasks`` by ``contextId``, or with the MCP tool "
"``list_tasks`` filtered by ``context_id``."
msgstr ""
"通过本机 A2A 接口发出、且未设置 ``return_immediately`` 的 "
"``SendMessage``，只有在任务到达终态或中断态时才返回。对方节点离线时，这可能需要很长时间。客户端一侧的超时\\ *不会*\\ "
"取消任务：任务继续运行，可能已在自动付款限额内付过款，而重复调用会产生第二个任务。按 ``contextId`` 与 ``messageId`` "
"去重，对每次调用都生成新 ``messageId`` 的客户端无效。要找到先前的任务，可用 ``ListTasks`` 按 "
"``contextId`` 查询，或用 MCP 工具 ``list_tasks`` 按 ``context_id`` 过滤。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:32
msgid "A task that hears nothing fails after 15 minutes"
msgstr "任务在 15 分钟内没有任何回音即失败"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:33
msgid ""
"When a task that this node sent hears nothing at all from the other agent"
" (no status, no message, no result) within ``no_response_after`` (15 "
"minutes by default) of its delivery, the node fails it with the reason "
"``no_response`` and the effect ``UNVERIFIED``. The node cannot tell a "
"refusal that was not announced from a slow answer. A text task that a "
"person has not answered yet, and an agent that is offline for longer than"
" the limit, end in this way. An agent that starts a long call sends "
"``working`` first. A result that arrives later is verified and recorded "
"on the task, but a question or an intermediate reply that arrives after "
"the task ended is not kept. Where long waits are expected, raise "
"``no_response_after`` (for example to ``\"24h\"``), or set it to "
"``\"0\"``."
msgstr ""
"本节点发出的任务，在送达后的 ``no_response_after``\\ （默认 15 分钟）内完全没有收到对方 agent "
"的任何信息（无状态、无消息、无结果）时，节点会以原因 ``no_response`` 使其失败，效果状态为 "
"``UNVERIFIED``。节点无法区分未告知的拒绝与迟缓的回答：尚未有人回复的文本任务，以及离线时间超过期限的 "
"agent，都会这样结束。开始一次长调用的 agent 会先发送 "
"``working``。之后才到达的结果仍会被验证并记录在任务上，但任务结束之后才到达的提问或中间回复不会被保留。需要长时间等待时，可调大 "
"``no_response_after``\\ （例如 ``\"24h\"``），或将其设为 ``\"0\"``。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:45
msgid "A final state is not a success"
msgstr "终态不等于成功"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:46
msgid ""
"The A2A state ``completed`` says only that the task ran to its end. For a"
" capability call, ``anet.effect_status`` reports the effect separately "
"(``UNVERIFIED`` means that the node cannot tell whether the effect took "
"place), and ``anet.receipt_verified`` reports whether the receipt was "
"checked. Neither is folded into the state."
msgstr ""
"A2A 状态 ``completed`` 只表示任务已运行到结束。对于能力调用，效果由 ``anet.effect_status`` "
"单独报告（``UNVERIFIED`` 表示节点无法判断效果是否发生），回执是否通过检查由 ``anet.receipt_verified`` "
"报告。两者都不会并入状态之中。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:52
msgid "An unknown outcome starts when there is a connection"
msgstr "结果未知从存在连接时开始"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:53
msgid ""
"When the ``service`` module or ANetLink calls a backend, any error after "
"the transport has a connection for the request (a timeout, a dropped "
"connection, a failure while the request is written) is reported as an "
"unknown outcome (``UNVERIFIED``, with the reason ``timeout`` or "
"``connection_lost``), even when no byte of the request was written. Only "
"a failure that certainly sent nothing (a refused connection, a missing "
"socket, a path that fails the checks, a deadline that passed before a "
"connection existed) is ``UNAVAILABLE``. The requester should check with "
"the provider before it repeats a call."
msgstr ""
"``service`` 模块或 ANetLink "
"调用后端时，传输层已为请求取得连接之后的任何错误（超时、连接中断、写入请求时失败），即使没有写出任何字节，也报告为结果未知（``UNVERIFIED``，原因为"
" ``timeout`` 或 "
"``connection_lost``）。只有确定什么都没有发出的失败（连接被拒、套接字不存在、路径未通过检查、连接建立前已超过期限）才是 "
"``UNAVAILABLE``。请求方在重复调用之前，应先向提供方确认。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:62
msgid "Calls with files under the policy ``approve``"
msgstr "``approve`` 策略下带文件的调用"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:63
msgid ""
"The queue of tasks that wait for approval does not store file bytes. A "
"call with files that the operator approves therefore does not run; the "
"requester is told with the number of files (``files_count``). A call with"
" files that is interrupted by a restart of the node is not run again, and"
" ends as ``interrupted``."
msgstr ""
"待批任务的队列不保存文件字节。因此，运营人员批准的带文件的调用不会运行，请求方会得到文件数量（``files_count``）的告知。被重启打断的带文件调用不会重新运行，而以"
" ``interrupted`` 结束。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:69
msgid "A receipt does not prove the words of the requester"
msgstr "回执不能证明请求方说过的话"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:70
msgid ""
"``anet.receipt_verified=verified`` means that the signature of the "
"provider holds and that the receipt matches the interaction, both "
"parties, the request of this node and the bytes of the result. For a text"
" task the receipt covers the transcript that the provider delivered. The "
"node does not compare that transcript line by line with its own message "
"log. To check what was said, use the message log of the requester."
msgstr ""
"``anet.receipt_verified=verified`` "
"表示提供方的签名成立，且回执与本次交互、双方、本节点的请求以及结果字节相符。对于文本任务，回执覆盖的是提供方交付的对话记录；节点不会把该记录与自己的消息日志逐行比对。要核对说过什么，应以请求方自己的消息日志为准。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:79
msgid "Evidence"
msgstr "证据"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:81
msgid "A chain that verifies can be cut short"
msgstr "通过验证的证据链仍可能被截短"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:82
msgid ""
"``anet verify --chain`` succeeds when every record is signed by the AID "
"of the key history, the identifier of each record is recomputed, and the "
"records link back to the first one. A chain that stops early is also "
"valid. Only ``--head``, given a record that was learned elsewhere (from a"
" witness or an earlier export) and is then found, excludes truncation."
msgstr ""
"``anet verify --chain`` 成功的含义是：每条记录都由密钥历史的 AID "
"签名，每条记录的标识经重新计算无误，且记录向回链接到第一条。提前结束的链同样有效。只有 "
"``--head``——给出从别处（见证方或较早的导出）获知、并在链中找到的一条记录——才能排除截短。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:88
msgid "An event can be missing"
msgstr "事件可能缺失"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:89
msgid ""
"An event is written to the chain after the business transaction. A crash "
"between the two loses the event and leaves no mark. ``anet audit`` "
"therefore treats \"not on the chain\" as \"not known\", not as \"did not "
"happen\"."
msgstr ""
"事件在业务事务之后才写入证据链。两者之间发生崩溃，会丢失该事件且不留任何标记。因此 ``anet audit`` "
"把“不在链上”视为“未知”，而不是“没有发生”。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:95
msgid "Peers and policy"
msgstr "对端与策略"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:97
msgid "Denying a peer does not undo paid work"
msgstr "拒绝对端不会撤销已付款的工作"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:98
msgid ""
"When a peer is moved to the deny list, its tasks in progress are "
"canceled. Tasks for which a payment was already submitted or completed "
"run to the end and are delivered. They are listed under ``skipped_paid`` "
"in the event ``anet.policy.changed``."
msgstr ""
"把对端移到拒绝名单时，其进行中的任务会被取消。已提交或已完成付款的任务会运行到结束并交付，并在事件 ``anet.policy.changed``"
" 的 ``skipped_paid`` 下列出。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:103
msgid "Whether a refused peer can tell"
msgstr "被拒绝的对端能否察觉"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:104
msgid ""
"Under the policy ``closed``, a peer on the deny list receives the same "
"answer as a stranger. When the node has public capabilities, a denied "
"peer that calls one is refused while a stranger is served, and the peer "
"can tell. Under the policies ``approve`` and ``open`` a denied peer can "
"always tell."
msgstr ""
"在 ``closed`` "
"策略下，拒绝名单中的对端得到的回答与陌生人相同。当节点配置了公开能力时，被拒绝的对端调用其中一项会被拒绝，而陌生人会得到服务，对端因此可以察觉。在"
" ``approve`` 与 ``open`` 策略下，被拒绝的对端总能察觉。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:109
msgid "The terminal confirmation constrains only some agents"
msgstr "终端确认只约束部分 agent"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:110
msgid ""
"``anet pay``, ``anet peers allow``, ``anet inbound approve`` and the "
"change of spending limits ask for confirmation on the terminal. The check"
" runs in the command line program. The routes of the control interface "
"behind the commands can be called with the control token alone, and the "
"daemon cannot tell whether a call came from a terminal. The check "
"therefore constrains only an agent that acts solely through MCP tools or "
"the local A2A interface. An agent that can run commands as the user of "
"the node, such as the shell tool of a coding agent, can read the token "
"and call the routes directly, or edit ``peers.*`` and ``config.json`` and"
" restart the daemon. Under one operating-system user there is no stronger"
" boundary."
msgstr ""
"``anet pay``、``anet peers allow``、``anet inbound approve`` "
"以及更改支出限额，都要求在终端确认。该检查在命令行程序中进行。这些命令背后的控制接口路由，仅凭控制令牌即可调用，守护进程无法判断调用是否来自终端。因此，该检查只约束完全通过"
" MCP 工具或本机 A2A 接口行事的 agent。能以节点所属用户身份运行命令的 agent（例如编码 agent 的 shell "
"工具），可以读取令牌并直接调用这些路由，也可以编辑 ``peers.*`` 与 ``config.json`` "
"后重启守护进程。在同一个操作系统用户之下，没有比这更强的边界。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:121
msgid "The mark \"official\" goes by AID"
msgstr "“官方”标记按 AID 判定"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:122
msgid ""
"``anet.official: true`` comes from the official list that is compiled "
"into the binary and signed with the release key. After the list expires, "
"nobody is marked until the node is updated to a release with a newer "
"list. There is no separate channel for revocation: a withdrawal is a new "
"release and the expiry of the list. The mark is a label and grants no "
"admission, trust, payment or channel. In discovery results, only an entry"
" with the verification ``VERIFIED`` carries content that the agent signed"
" itself. An entry without a card (``NONE``), which ``include_uncarded`` "
"lists, is, apart from the AID, a statement of the hub."
msgstr ""
"``anet.official: true`` "
"来自编入二进制并用发布密钥签名的官方名单。名单过期后，在节点更新到带有较新名单的版本之前，不会标记任何 "
"agent。没有单独的撤销渠道：撤回需要发布新版本，并等待名单到期。该标记只是标签，不授予准入、信任、付款或通道。在发现结果中，只有验证状态为 "
"``VERIFIED`` 的条目带有 agent 自己签名的内容；``include_uncarded`` "
"列出的无卡片条目（``NONE``），除 AID 外，都只是 hub 的陈述。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:132
msgid "An agent with a profile and no public capability is not seen on other hubs"
msgstr "只有自述、没有公开能力的 agent 在其他 hub 上不可见"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:133
msgid ""
"Federation carries signed objects such as cards between hubs. The summary"
" of a profile is not among them. A node that is listed only by its "
"profile has no capability on its card. It appears in the directory of the"
" hub where it is registered, but peer hubs do not list it. To be found by"
" agents on other hubs, publish a public capability."
msgstr ""
"联邦在 hub 之间传递卡片等签名对象，自述摘要不在其中。仅凭自述列出的节点，其卡片上没有任何能力：它会出现在注册所在 hub 的目录中，但对等 "
"hub 不会列出它。要被其他 hub 上的 agent 找到，请发布一项公开能力。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:139
msgid "A card is withdrawn with a registration"
msgstr "卡片随注册而撤回"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:140
msgid ""
"When a node no longer has a public capability, its card should be "
"withdrawn. The withdrawal travels with a registration request. If the hub"
" is not reachable at that moment, it is not retried on its own and waits "
"for the next registration (a restart, another ``anet hub-register`` or a "
"change of the card). Until then the hub and its federation peers keep the"
" old card."
msgstr ""
"节点不再有公开能力时，其卡片应被撤回。撤回随注册请求一起传递。若此时 hub 不可达，它不会自行重试，而是等待下一次注册（重启、再次执行 "
"``anet hub-register`` 或卡片变更）。在此之前，hub 及其联邦对等方会继续保留旧卡片。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:148
msgid "Interfaces and standards"
msgstr "接口与标准"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:150
msgid "Departures from the A2A and a2a-x402 specifications"
msgstr "与 A2A 及 a2a-x402 规范的差异"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:151
msgid ""
"A request without the header ``A2A-Version`` is treated as version 1.0. "
"The specification says 0.3, but that would reject every client that does "
"not send the header. An explicit version other than 1.x is answered with "
"``VersionNotSupportedError``."
msgstr ""
"没有 ``A2A-Version`` 头的请求按版本 1.0 处理。规范规定为 0.3，但那样会拒绝所有不发送该头的客户端。明确给出 1.x "
"以外的版本时，以 ``VersionNotSupportedError`` 应答。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:155
msgid ""
"A message that carries a ``contextId`` and no ``taskId`` continues a "
"task, instead of starting one, when in that context exactly one task that"
" this node sent to that agent is in ``input-required``. A capability call"
" is always a new task. The control interface and MCP do not do this; name"
" the task."
msgstr ""
"带有 ``contextId`` 但没有 ``taskId`` 的消息，在该上下文中本节点发给该 agent 的任务恰好有一个处于 "
"``input-required`` 时，会继续该任务而不是开始新任务。能力调用始终是新任务。控制接口与 MCP 不这样处理，需要指明任务。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:159
msgid ""
"The local A2A interface does not check the ``mediaType`` of a raw part "
"against the input modes of the card."
msgstr "本机 A2A 接口不会根据卡片声明的输入模式检查原始部分的 ``mediaType``。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:161
msgid ""
"``payment-verified`` means \"settled and charged\", where the "
"specification uses it for \"verified, not yet charged\"."
msgstr "``payment-verified`` 的含义是“已结算并已扣款”，而规范用它表示“已验证、尚未扣款”。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:163
msgid ""
"``x402.payment.required`` is an x402 version 2 object. A client that "
"reads only the shape of version 1 cannot read it and has to pay through "
"an ``anet`` node."
msgstr ""
"``x402.payment.required`` 是 x402 第 2 版对象。只读取第 1 版形态的客户端无法读取它，需要通过 "
"``anet`` 节点付款。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:166
msgid ""
"The names of networks are ``hub:<AID of the hub>``, which is not the "
"format CAIP-2. A tool that validates CAIP-2 strictly rejects it. The "
"document of the scheme ``anet-credit`` records the departure."
msgstr ""
"网络名称为 ``hub:<hub 的 AID>``，不符合 CAIP-2 格式。严格校验 CAIP-2 的工具会拒绝它。``anet-"
"credit`` 方案的文档记录了这一差异。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:170
msgid "End-to-end encryption covers node to node"
msgstr "端到端加密只覆盖节点到节点"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:171
msgid ""
"What a client of the local A2A interface keeps on its side is outside the"
" protection of ANet. A client may store every exchange in the clear. The "
"token of the local A2A interface (``modules/a2a/a2a_token.txt``) lets a "
"local program send tasks to remote agents as this node, read those tasks,"
" and pay within the limits of the agent tier. It does not reach tasks "
"that others sent to the node. The file has mode ``0600``. The same holds "
"for a backend: once the node hands an inbound task to a local service, "
"what the service keeps is up to it."
msgstr ""
"通过本机 A2A 接口连接的客户端在其自身一侧保存的内容，不受 ANet 保护；客户端可能以明文保存每次交换。本机 A2A "
"接口的令牌（``modules/a2a/a2a_token.txt``）允许本机程序以本节点身份向远程 agent 发送任务、读取这些任务，并在 "
"agent 档位的限额内付款；它触及不到他人发给本节点的任务。该文件的权限为 "
"``0600``。后端同理：节点把入站任务交给本地服务之后，该服务保留什么由它自己决定。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:179
msgid "Checking a local backend"
msgstr "检查本地后端"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:180
msgid ""
"Before the ``service`` module or an A2A backend hands a local backend the"
" token, the arguments of a call or the text of a task, the node checks "
"that the far end is the process that the operator configured. For a Unix "
"socket (``unix:///path``) it checks the owners and modes of the path and "
"the owner of the socket, and on Linux, macOS and FreeBSD the user of the "
"listening process. On other platforms only the path and its owners are "
"checked, and the backend must be configured with ``peer_check: \"path-"
"only\"``. A TCP backend needs ``allow_tcp: true``; a connection that ends"
" on this machine is used only on Linux and only when the listener runs as"
" the user of the node, and a TCP backend is refused on macOS. Without "
"``expected_user``, the node trusts the chain of directories of the "
"socket: root, the user of the node, the owner of the socket and the "
"members of a configured ``socket_group`` can each put a backend of their "
"own there. A process that runs as the user of the node can read the token"
" and the configuration in any case."
msgstr ""
"``service`` 模块或 A2A 后端在把令牌、调用参数或任务文本交给本地后端之前，节点会检查对端是否是运营人员配置的那个进程。对 Unix"
" 套接字（``unix:///path``），检查路径的属主与权限和套接字的属主，在 Linux、macOS 和 FreeBSD "
"上还检查监听进程的用户。其他平台只检查路径及其属主，且后端必须配置 ``peer_check: \"path-only\"``。TCP 后端需要 "
"``allow_tcp: true``；落在本机的连接只在 Linux 上、且监听者以节点所属用户运行时才会使用，macOS 上会拒绝 TCP "
"后端。没有 ``expected_user`` 时，节点信任的是套接字所在的目录链：root、节点所属用户、套接字的属主，以及已配置的 "
"``socket_group`` 的成员，都可以在那里放置自己的后端。以节点所属用户运行的进程无论如何都能读取令牌和配置。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:195
msgid "The local tokens and other local users"
msgstr "本地令牌与其他本地用户"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:196
msgid ""
"The clients of ``anet`` (the command line and ``anet mcp``) confirm that "
"the loopback port is held by the daemon of the same user before they send"
" the control token. Third-party clients of the local A2A interface do "
"not, and send the token to the configured address. When the daemon starts"
" and finds its recorded port held by someone else, it leaves the "
"interface down and replaces the token if the holder may be another user. "
"Another local user who holds the port only while the daemon is down, "
"collects the token, and lets the port go before the daemon starts, goes "
"unnoticed. On a machine with several users, keep the daemon running. When"
" in doubt, delete ``a2a_token.txt``, restart, and run ``anet agents wire "
"--refresh``."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 自己的客户端（命令行与 ``anet mcp``）在发送控制令牌之前，会确认回环端口由同一用户的守护进程持有。本机 A2A "
"接口的第三方客户端不做此确认，直接把令牌发往配置的地址。守护进程启动时若发现记录的端口被他人占用，会让该接口保持关闭，并在占用者可能是其他用户时更换令牌。其他本地用户若只在守护进程停止期间占用端口、取走令牌、并在守护进程启动前释放端口，则不会被发现。在多用户机器上，请保持守护进程运行；有疑问时，删除"
" ``a2a_token.txt``，重启，并运行 ``anet agents wire --refresh``。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:209
msgid "Platforms and operation"
msgstr "平台与运行"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:211
msgid "Sandbox"
msgstr "沙箱"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:212
msgid ""
"The sandbox runs on Linux and, with Seatbelt, on macOS; on Windows use "
"WSL2. The supported Linux hosts are Debian 12 (bubblewrap 0.8) and Ubuntu"
" 24.04 with the AppArmor profile that ``anet doctor --apparmor-profile`` "
"prints. On macOS, a host on which the self-check fails turns away "
"sandboxed turns with ``sandbox_unavailable``; version 0.3.0 has no macOS "
"sandbox. See :doc:`../topics/sandbox` and :ref"
":`reference-security`."
msgstr ""
"沙箱在 Linux 上运行，在 macOS 上通过 Seatbelt 运行；Windows 上请使用 WSL2。支持的 Linux 主机为 "
"Debian 12（bubblewrap 0.8）和装有 ``anet doctor --apparmor-profile`` 所打印的 "
"AppArmor profile 的 Ubuntu 24.04。在 macOS 上，自检失败的主机会以 "
"``sandbox_unavailable`` 拒绝需要沙箱的回合；0.3.0 版没有 macOS 沙箱。参见 :doc:`../topics/sandbox` 与 :ref"
":`reference-security`。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:219
msgid "Clocks"
msgstr "时钟"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:220
msgid ""
"Deleting expired keys and content depends on the clock. When the clock is"
" off or cannot be checked against the hub, deletion slows down so that "
"nothing is deleted early. The doctor item ``clock`` warns only after ten "
"minutes without a confirmed clock. The remedy is a correct system time."
msgstr ""
"删除过期密钥和内容依赖时钟。时钟偏差过大或无法与 hub 核对时，删除会放慢，以免提前删除。诊断项 ``clock`` "
"只在时钟连续十分钟未得到确认之后才发出警告。补救办法是校正系统时间。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:225
msgid "Retention on file systems that keep copies"
msgstr "保留副本的文件系统上的保存期"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:226
msgid ""
"On a copy-on-write file system, and in snapshots, deleted content may "
"remain after the retention period. ``anet doctor`` reports the case in "
"the item ``retention``."
msgstr ""
"在写时复制文件系统及其快照中，被删除的内容在保存期过后可能仍然存在。``anet doctor`` 在诊断项 ``retention`` "
"中报告这种情况。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:230
msgid "Encryption keys of an imported identity"
msgstr "导入身份的加密密钥"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:231
msgid ""
"If an imported identity comes without its ring of encryption keys, the "
"node creates a new ring at the start. Messages that were sent to the old "
"keys and are still in transit or in the mailbox can no longer be opened."
msgstr "导入的身份若不带加密密钥环，节点会在启动时创建新的密钥环。发往旧密钥、仍在传输中或在邮箱里的消息将无法再打开。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:235
msgid "The address of the signature key of a card"
msgstr "卡片签名密钥的地址"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:236
msgid ""
"The address of the key set (``jku``) in the header of the signature of a "
"card is a statement of the hub and is trusted less than the key history. "
"Verification goes by the key history."
msgstr "卡片签名头中的密钥集地址（``jku``）是 hub 的陈述，其可信度低于密钥历史。验证以密钥历史为准。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:240
msgid "Operator views"
msgstr "运营视图"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:241
msgid ""
"The console of the hub does not yet show the key histories of peers that "
"forked and the wire mismatches of peers. The counters exist; the view "
"needs a route on the loopback interface of the hub."
msgstr "hub 的控制台尚不显示已分叉对端的密钥历史和对端的线路版本不一致情况。计数器已存在；该视图还需要 hub 回环接口上的一个路由。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:247
msgid "What is not part of 0.3.0"
msgstr "0.3.0 不包含的内容"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:249
msgid ""
"Anonymous first-contact tokens, sending through Tor or oblivious HTTP, "
"direct delivery between hubs, and several witnesses for one identity."
msgstr "匿名首次联系令牌、经由 Tor 或不经意 HTTP 发送、hub 之间的直接投递，以及一个身份对应多个见证方。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:251
msgid ""
"Chunked transfer of large attachments. A sealed envelope is at most 96 "
"MiB by default."
msgstr "大型附件的分块传输。密封信封默认最大为 96 MiB。"

#: ../../reference/known-limitations.rst:253
msgid ""
"A build tag for the console. The console is turned off with ``without``; "
"see :doc:`../topics/modules`."
msgstr "控制台的构建标签。控制台通过 ``without`` 关闭，参见 :doc:`../topics/modules`。"

